---
title: Steady-State CDC - Sequence (EAST to WEST)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as Scheduler in WEST
    participant JOB as CDC job in WEST
    participant DRS as dr_state
    participant SRC as EAST registry source
    participant VOL as WEST staging volume
    participant DST as WEST registry dest
    participant AUD as Audit and inventory

    SCH->>JOB: trigger every ~15m
    JOB->>DRS: read active_primary
    DRS-->>JOB: east, so direction = EAST to WEST
    JOB->>SRC: assume source identity, list models and versions
    JOB->>AUD: read per-model watermark and last signature
    Note over JOB: detect_changes = version diff + metadata drift + optional audit scan
    alt nothing changed
        JOB->>AUD: log nothing to sync
    else changed models
        JOB->>DST: pre-scan versions WEST already holds
        JOB->>SRC: export delta, skip synced versions, with retry
        SRC-->>VOL: bundle of new versions plus full metadata
        JOB->>DST: import append-only, delete_model=false, with retry
        JOB->>DST: verify imported versions equal expected
        JOB->>AUD: IMPORT SUCCESS, watermark advances, upsert signature
        JOB->>AUD: VERIFY row with source_event_time for RPO
    end
    Note over JOB,AUD: per-model isolation - one failing model is recorded, others continue, job fails loudly at end
